(5861387, 853086, 114089, '<td valign="top">Great perspective brings us down to the child''s level right into her world. Lovely color and detail.</td>', 'Great perspective brings us down to the child''s level right into her world. Lovely color and detail.', '2010-02-10 05:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
