(5861741, 852864, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot here for composition and color. This perspective keeps the abstract feel even though this is more revealistic. <br/> <br/><i>(At least now I know what the I was looking at when I checked out your B&amp;W abstracts in the PAW 2010 thread!!)</i> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=852869" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102278/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_852869.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102278/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_852869.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/102278/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_852869.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Very interesting shot here for composition and color. This perspective keeps the abstract feel even though this is more revealistic.  (At least now I know what the I was looking at when I checked out your B&W abstracts in the PAW 2010 thread!!)  ', '2010-02-10 11:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861748, 853104, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot! Every shot has a perspective, even if it is shot straight on. This would have much more effective as a perspective composition if the inside of the tube was actually visible and we could see the textures and shape of the tube leading to the scene at the end. What you have shown here is more of a negative space type composition with a selective focus rather than a perspective view.</td>', 'Very creative shot! Every shot has a perspective, even if it is shot straight on. This would have much more effective as a perspective composition if the inside of the tube was actually visible and we could see the textures and shape of the tube leading to the scene at the end. What you have shown here is more of a negative space type composition with a selective focus rather than a perspective view.', '2010-02-10 11:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861761, 852544, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great use of color, motion and exposure to create a focus on the subject. The blown out background does not matter in my opinion as my eye goes right to the child framed by the tire. (Which is another great compositional element... natural framing.) A very happy feel to this with an interesting perspective. Some might not like the lens flare, but I don''t mind it at all.</td>', 'Great use of color, motion and exposure to create a focus on the subject. The blown out background does not matter in my opinion as my eye goes right to the child framed by the tire. (Which is another great compositional element... natural framing.) A very happy feel to this with an interesting perspective. Some might not like the lens flare, but I don''t mind it at all.', '2010-02-10 11:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861764, 852729, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very nice find. It would have been much better to put something of interest to focus on down the tunnel, even a person walking towards or away from the camera. Throw the camera on a mini pod and take a picture of yourself even!</td>', 'Very nice find. It would have been much better to put something of interest to focus on down the tunnel, even a person walking towards or away from the camera. Throw the camera on a mini pod and take a picture of yourself even!', '2010-02-10 11:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861767, 852412, 113278, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks. This is excellent. It really draws you and and makes you wonder. 10 and hope you get top 3.</td>', 'One of my top picks. This is excellent. It really draws you and and makes you wonder. 10 and hope you get top 3.', '2010-02-10 11:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861768, 852584, 113278, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. Great shot. Hope you get a top 3 with this.</td>', 'One of my favorites. Great shot. Hope you get a top 3 with this.', '2010-02-10 11:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861769, 853155, 79681, '<td valign="top">Great Shot. I like the intersecting lines that the mirrors create! But i would have tried to capture the stairs and people without burring them!</td>', 'Great Shot. I like the intersecting lines that the mirrors create! But i would have tried to capture the stairs and people without burring them!', '2010-02-10 11:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861772, 852544, 79681, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot for "perspective". I would suggest adjusting the brightness and focus. Use a faster shutter speed.</td>', 'This is a great shot for "perspective". I would suggest adjusting the brightness and focus. Use a faster shutter speed.', '2010-02-10 11:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861774, 852224, 79681, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea for perspective with the basic editing rules. I could see this being photoshopped with an out of focus background and overlayed with only the bike in focus! Nice concept!</td>', 'This is a nice idea for perspective with the basic editing rules. I could see this being photoshopped with an out of focus background and overlayed with only the bike in focus! Nice concept!', '2010-02-10 11:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861776, 853206, 10785, '<td valign="top">What makes this blurry mess good is the great compsitional elements... the X and the vanishing point. Also the colors of the lights are stand out against the blue to black background. Awesome job!</td>', 'What makes this blurry mess good is the great compsitional elements... the X and the vanishing point. Also the colors of the lights are stand out against the blue to black background. Awesome job!', '2010-02-10 12:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861777, 852046, 79681, '<td valign="top">I would have somehow tried to exclude the Red beams! But great concept!</td>', 'I would have somehow tried to exclude the Red beams! But great concept!', '2010-02-10 12:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861778, 852998, 105457, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I had a Canon camera on my hand...it took all my willpower not to drop it :)<br/> <br/>Just joking, it was very nice to help Insomniac doing this shot, it was a great idea from him, and really hope it will be understood by the voters (not voting).</td>', 'I can''t believe I had a Canon camera on my hand...it took all my willpower not to drop it :) Just joking, it was very nice to help Insomniac doing this shot, it was a great idea from him, and really hope it will be understood by the voters (not voting).', '2010-02-10 12:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861781, 852066, 79681, '<td valign="top">i like the Perspective. I dont know if i like the person there in the middle. I am not sure, but it doesn''t seem to fit!. Great Shot though!</td>', 'i like the Perspective. I dont know if i like the person there in the middle. I am not sure, but it doesn''t seem to fit!. Great Shot though!', '2010-02-10 12:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861800, 852737, 112177, '<td valign="top">This is very unique image.  The lighting must have been a big challenge.  Lighting I can''t control always seems like a crap shoot, even though I try to edit it or work with what I get, I always seem to find it''s never what I expected when I shot the photo.  I especially like the perspective and dimension of the balloons in relationship to the balconies. It not only meets your challenge but is pleasing to the artistic eye. Please accept my Bravo! Well thought out and great capture!</td>', 'This is very unique image.  The lighting must have been a big challenge.  Lighting I can''t control always seems like a crap shoot, even though I try to edit it or work with what I get, I always seem to find it''s never what I expected when I shot the photo.  I especially like the perspective and dimension of the balloons in relationship to the balconies. It not only meets your challenge but is pleasing to the artistic eye. Please accept my Bravo! Well thought out and great capture!', '2010-02-10 12:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861806, 853043, 112177, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I see where your perspective line is. My eye is drawn to the upper left corner of the image not your perspective line.  I like your choice of black and white for this challenge.  It makes you image more dramatic and the lines more visible.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I see where your perspective line is. My eye is drawn to the upper left corner of the image not your perspective line.  I like your choice of black and white for this challenge.  It makes you image more dramatic and the lines more visible.', '2010-02-10 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861809, 853192, 112177, '<td valign="top">I see your subject but it is a little too dark for me, I had to look really hard to see the victim.  The perspective here is interesting.</td>', 'I see your subject but it is a little too dark for me, I had to look really hard to see the victim.  The perspective here is interesting.', '2010-02-10 12:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5861811, 852971, 112177, '<td valign="top">Great color choice and subject.  I wasn''t distracted by the person on the left either.  You honed in so well on your focal point that it draws me in as well.  Very nice</td>', 'Great color choice and subject.  I wasn''t distracted by the person on the left either.  You honed in so well on your focal point that it draws me in as well.  Very nice', '2010-02-10 12:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
