(5865036, 853181, 10785, '<td valign="top">Somewhat creative image with the leading line to the horizon. As far as perspective goes, it seems to be shot straight ahead without any real angles or different view. You did a good job with the lighting here however there isn''t much color or any real subject to make it overly interesting. It is well exposed and quite sharp!</td>', 'Somewhat creative image with the leading line to the horizon. As far as perspective goes, it seems to be shot straight ahead without any real angles or different view. You did a good job with the lighting here however there isn''t much color or any real subject to make it overly interesting. It is well exposed and quite sharp!', '2010-02-12 20:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5865039, 852853, 83686, '<td valign="top">Not really seeing "perspective" here. Top of the photo is really blown out probably due to lighting and the time of day when you took the shot. I do like the PP coloring though.</td>', 'Not really seeing "perspective" here. Top of the photo is really blown out probably due to lighting and the time of day when you took the shot. I do like the PP coloring though.', '2010-02-12 20:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
