(5865887, 852688, 75618, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very harsh (from direct camera flash I''m assuming), try diffusing it through a white sheet of paper. Dust/lint in the screen is very distracting. The purple background is uneven. The coiled headphones could have been arranged more pleasantly. Sorry if it sounded harsh, just some constructive criticisms.</td>', 'Lighting is very harsh (from direct camera flash I''m assuming), try diffusing it through a white sheet of paper. Dust/lint in the screen is very distracting. The purple background is uneven. The coiled headphones could have been arranged more pleasantly. Sorry if it sounded harsh, just some constructive criticisms.', '2010-02-13 18:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
