(5867937, 852864, 112107, '<td valign="top">Beautiful high key.<br/>Great perspective.<br/>1* short of 10* just because the double black border is distracting. Just the inner one would have worked fine IMHO.</td>', 'Beautiful high key.Great perspective.1* short of 10* just because the double black border is distracting. Just the inner one would have worked fine IMHO.', '2010-02-15 12:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
