(5867961, 851890, 112107, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, great PP, very dramatic really.<br/>Great contrasts between light and dark, close and far, soft and sharp.<br/>9* just because the PP is slightly overdone.</td>', 'Great lighting, great PP, very dramatic really.Great contrasts between light and dark, close and far, soft and sharp.9* just because the PP is slightly overdone.', '2010-02-15 12:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
