(5867964, 852716, 112107, '<td valign="top">The best spirited photo in the whole pack.<br/>Excelent sharpness and tones. Makes you forget about the background.<br/>9*</td>', 'The best spirited photo in the whole pack.Excelent sharpness and tones. Makes you forget about the background.9*', '2010-02-15 12:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5867972, 852412, 112107, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo but there is something that I can''t quite figure about the background (walls, windows and floor). I guess that if there were a more contrasting elementt would have helped as there are only middle tones there.<br/>The extreme placement of the subjects doesn''t bother me.<br/>9*</td>', 'I really like this photo but there is something that I can''t quite figure about the background (walls, windows and floor). I guess that if there were a more contrasting elementt would have helped as there are only middle tones there.The extreme placement of the subjects doesn''t bother me.9*', '2010-02-15 12:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5867977, 853113, 112107, '<td valign="top">Fantastic contrast between light and shade, straight and curved, soft and sharp, one and many.<br/>One of my favorites.<br/>Downgraded to 9*, re-upgraded to 10*.</td>', 'Fantastic contrast between light and shade, straight and curved, soft and sharp, one and many.One of my favorites.Downgraded to 9*, re-upgraded to 10*.', '2010-02-15 12:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5867978, 852729, 112107, '<td valign="top">Great tones, great perspective.<br/>9*</td>', 'Great tones, great perspective.9*', '2010-02-15 12:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5867979, 852046, 112107, '<td valign="top">Just a little better framing and it would have been perfect.</td>', 'Just a little better framing and it would have been perfect.', '2010-02-15 12:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5867981, 852321, 112107, '<td valign="top">This is surely a brown attempt but clearly you failed because I liked it and I''m giving it 7*.</td>', 'This is surely a brown attempt but clearly you failed because I liked it and I''m giving it 7*.', '2010-02-15 12:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5867983, 852937, 112107, '<td valign="top">I had given this photo a 9* but after reviewing my top picks I just had to upgrade.<br/>This is a fine example for a composition lesson: the framing to the Golden Mean, the contrast between warm and cold, soft and sharp, close and far, dark and light.<br/>Perfect.<br/>I''m curious to see the techs.</td>', 'I had given this photo a 9* but after reviewing my top picks I just had to upgrade.This is a fine example for a composition lesson: the framing to the Golden Mean, the contrast between warm and cold, soft and sharp, close and far, dark and light.Perfect.I''m curious to see the techs.', '2010-02-15 12:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5867984, 853204, 112107, '<td valign="top">Had given it a 9 but after seeing the rest of the pack I really have to upgrade.<br/>What tension, what dynamics! What a fight is going here...<br/>Makes you wish to jump in!<br/> <br/>Up there with this one: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=839002" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1138/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_839002.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1138/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_839002.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1138/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_839002.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Had given it a 9 but after seeing the rest of the pack I really have to upgrade.What tension, what dynamics! What a fight is going here...Makes you wish to jump in! Up there with this one: ', '2010-02-15 12:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5868014, 853204, 111773, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition. Really like the angle of this shot too! Very nice.</td>', 'Awesome composition. Really like the angle of this shot too! Very nice.', '2010-02-15 13:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5868016, 853173, 111773, '<td valign="top">Great composition! Very nicely done! I''m really digging the street view.</td>', 'Great composition! Very nicely done! I''m really digging the street view.', '2010-02-15 13:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5868027, 852523, 111123, '<td valign="top">That''s one good looking model you have!</td>', 'That''s one good looking model you have!', '2010-02-15 13:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5868340, 852852, 112107, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. This is one I really would like to get in the critique basket.<br/>Reminds me both of the works of <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alexandr_Rodchenko" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Alexander Rodchenko</a> and <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lenni_Riefenstal" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lenni Riefenstal</a> namely her <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olympia_(movie)" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Olympia</a> movie which was largely used in Rammstein''s cover for <a href="//www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y869l-35JLQ" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Striped </a> by Depeche Mode.<br/>10*.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. This is one I really would like to get in the critique basket.Reminds me both of the works of Alexander Rodchenko and Lenni Riefenstal namely her Olympia movie which was largely used in Rammstein''s cover for Striped  by Depeche Mode.10*.', '2010-02-15 18:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5868548, 853113, 108313, '<td valign="top">Great picture and composition! If you only had waited just 3 more seconds (if that clock is working...) in order to make a 90 degree angle with the pointers, it would have been perfect! The seconds pointer would reinforce the direction of the pole and the building. But these are just little things. It''s a great picture! Congrats!!</td>', 'Great picture and composition! If you only had waited just 3 more seconds (if that clock is working...) in order to make a 90 degree angle with the pointers, it would have been perfect! The seconds pointer would reinforce the direction of the pole and the building. But these are just little things. It''s a great picture! Congrats!!', '2010-02-15 22:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5868567, 853233, 113214, '<td valign="top">I like this shot A LOT...just wish it was composed to include the full glass / coke can.</td>', 'I like this shot A LOT...just wish it was composed to include the full glass / coke can.', '2010-02-15 22:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5868724, 852864, 42013, '<td valign="top">I give up. If it is a musical instrument(like a guitar) then you have truly created a unique view.<br/> <br/>or is it the side of a building with a street lamp?</td>', 'I give up. If it is a musical instrument(like a guitar) then you have truly created a unique view. or is it the side of a building with a street lamp?', '2010-02-16 02:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
