(5869232, 852539, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice dof but I would not have been able to guess that those are waterdrops. In fact I have no idea what i am looking at here and I don''t get any feeling of perspective either. 4</td>', 'Nice dof but I would not have been able to guess that those are waterdrops. In fact I have no idea what i am looking at here and I don''t get any feeling of perspective either. 4', '2010-02-16 12:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
