(5869234, 852985, 99263, '<td valign="top">Interesting structure but no feeling of perspective at all. This could be a close up of a small object or it could be a very large sculpture. No way to tell.<br/>4</td>', 'Interesting structure but no feeling of perspective at all. This could be a close up of a small object or it could be a very large sculpture. No way to tell.4', '2010-02-16 12:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
