(5869247, 853232, 105079, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, I like dubious subject matter, what are these, servers of some kind?</td>', 'This is interesting, I like dubious subject matter, what are these, servers of some kind?', '2010-02-16 13:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869248, 852737, 99263, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors,shapes,lines and patterns in this eye catching perspective. 10<br/>Yours is the only 10 I gave in this challenge by the way.</td>', 'Wonderful colors,shapes,lines and patterns in this eye catching perspective. 10Yours is the only 10 I gave in this challenge by the way.', '2010-02-16 13:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869251, 853198, 105079, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I think what I really like is the weightlessness feel I get when I look at the globs of water against the epic blue sky.  The shadows and the arcs of water with the grid of the bricks is a complicated and perhaps under accentuated juxtaposition.</td>', 'I like this, but I think what I really like is the weightlessness feel I get when I look at the globs of water against the epic blue sky.  The shadows and the arcs of water with the grid of the bricks is a complicated and perhaps under accentuated juxtaposition.', '2010-02-16 13:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869252, 853270, 105079, '<td valign="top">this has a ''magazine shot'' feel to me.  It would be a nice stock image dealing with eco tourism, or tourism in general.</td>', 'this has a ''magazine shot'' feel to me.  It would be a nice stock image dealing with eco tourism, or tourism in general.', '2010-02-16 13:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869253, 853272, 105079, '<td valign="top">it''s amazing how such a mundane place, properly tweaked, can be one of the scariest environments you''ve EVER seen!</td>', 'it''s amazing how such a mundane place, properly tweaked, can be one of the scariest environments you''ve EVER seen!', '2010-02-16 13:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869254, 852918, 105079, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the sepia tone, though the subject matter is quite interesting.  Perhaps a straight on, wide-angle, texture-like shot of the same subject matter.</td>', 'I don''t like the sepia tone, though the subject matter is quite interesting.  Perhaps a straight on, wide-angle, texture-like shot of the same subject matter.', '2010-02-16 13:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869255, 852569, 105079, '<td valign="top">I respect where you''re going with this.  I''m not sure what I want to see more out of this, but there is something.</td>', 'I respect where you''re going with this.  I''m not sure what I want to see more out of this, but there is something.', '2010-02-16 13:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869256, 852789, 105079, '<td valign="top">A truly interesting perspective.  This adheres to the challenge criteria to the T.  The over exposure is nice.  For some reason though, I want to see more yellow and orange blocks.</td>', 'A truly interesting perspective.  This adheres to the challenge criteria to the T.  The over exposure is nice.  For some reason though, I want to see more yellow and orange blocks.', '2010-02-16 13:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869258, 853248, 105079, '<td valign="top">The juxtaposition is neat but I think the color is a little ''poppy.''</td>', 'The juxtaposition is neat but I think the color is a little ''poppy.''', '2010-02-16 13:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869259, 853200, 105079, '<td valign="top">Strange.  You should sell this to Oprah.  I like the grid on the sidewalk with the crazy pink O.</td>', 'Strange.  You should sell this to Oprah.  I like the grid on the sidewalk with the crazy pink O.', '2010-02-16 13:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869261, 853184, 105079, '<td valign="top">HEY! You guys stole our winter!  It''s an el niño year!  I want to see the blue pop out more in the sky.</td>', 'HEY! You guys stole our winter!  It''s an el niño year!  I want to see the blue pop out more in the sky.', '2010-02-16 13:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869262, 852729, 105079, '<td valign="top">An interesting location but maybe get lower and center the composition with a wide-angle.</td>', 'An interesting location but maybe get lower and center the composition with a wide-angle.', '2010-02-16 13:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869263, 852627, 113740, '<td valign="top">Neat!</td>', 'Neat!', '2010-02-16 13:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869265, 852963, 105079, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It''s clear and crisp.</td>', 'I like this.  It''s clear and crisp.', '2010-02-16 13:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869267, 853219, 113740, '<td valign="top">Well done! One of my favorites from this challenge. :)</td>', 'Well done! One of my favorites from this challenge. :)', '2010-02-16 13:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869268, 852618, 105079, '<td valign="top">looks like the color is a burnt a little in the sky.  If the pink is going to be so accentuated then I''d like to see the green of the bushes and the blue of the towers pop out a little more.  Maybe put the orb-like sculpture up against a sky background, it''s an interesting shape and should be more focused.  I like the use of the fisheye though.</td>', 'looks like the color is a burnt a little in the sky.  If the pink is going to be so accentuated then I''d like to see the green of the bushes and the blue of the towers pop out a little more.  Maybe put the orb-like sculpture up against a sky background, it''s an interesting shape and should be more focused.  I like the use of the fisheye though.', '2010-02-16 13:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869270, 853192, 105079, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!  This is cool!  I put a photo up once that depicted a dead creature and I had people chastising me about it on here.  Don''t let ''em get to ya, this is a neat photo.</td>', 'Ha ha!  This is cool!  I put a photo up once that depicted a dead creature and I had people chastising me about it on here.  Don''t let ''em get to ya, this is a neat photo.', '2010-02-16 13:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869271, 852951, 105079, '<td valign="top">I think there needs to be a centralized focal point here.  I want to see something at the bottom of the escalator, the details of the steps aren''t enough for me.</td>', 'I think there needs to be a centralized focal point here.  I want to see something at the bottom of the escalator, the details of the steps aren''t enough for me.', '2010-02-16 13:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869274, 853251, 105079, '<td valign="top">... we are the Borg, lower your shields and surrender your ships!<br/> <br/>The horizontal composition is, I think, the power of this shot.</td>', '... we are the Borg, lower your shields and surrender your ships! The horizontal composition is, I think, the power of this shot.', '2010-02-16 13:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869275, 852065, 105079, '<td valign="top">This only works because it''s immaculately composed and incredibly complicated.  (that is a compliment :)</td>', 'This only works because it''s immaculately composed and incredibly complicated.  (that is a compliment :)', '2010-02-16 13:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869276, 852962, 105079, '<td valign="top">I think with the statue there this photo is (no pun intended) ''saved.''  It''s very difficult to photograph architecture, especially in this fashion, maybe pop the colors out a little more.</td>', 'I think with the statue there this photo is (no pun intended) ''saved.''  It''s very difficult to photograph architecture, especially in this fashion, maybe pop the colors out a little more.', '2010-02-16 13:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869277, 852046, 105079, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective but I''d like to see the colors a little more desaturated, maybe just near monochromatic.</td>', 'Cool perspective but I''d like to see the colors a little more desaturated, maybe just near monochromatic.', '2010-02-16 13:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869279, 853003, 113740, '<td valign="top">Fantastic :)</td>', 'Fantastic :)', '2010-02-16 13:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5869281, 852864, 105079, '<td valign="top">when I saw this I said; "W T F is that?!" (I am censoring myself here)  Congratulations, you elicited a shocking response in me, you''ve done your job as an artist.<br/>The colors aren''t offensively popped and it are blended well with the over exposure.  The unusual shapes are great!</td>', 'when I saw this I said; "W T F is that?!" (I am censoring myself here)  Congratulations, you elicited a shocking response in me, you''ve done your job as an artist.The colors aren''t offensively popped and it are blended well with the over exposure.  The unusual shapes are great!', '2010-02-16 13:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
