(5870343, 853081, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Trinilos:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m an amateur photographer just starting out, so be easy! But I''m very open to helpful criticism or anything that you feel I could have done to improve this photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>if you are open to helpful criticism then dont just check the compliments as "helpful" you''ll learn alot more from the critical ones, i know from experience</td>', 'Originally posted by Trinilos: I''m an amateur photographer just starting out, so be easy! But I''m very open to helpful criticism or anything that you feel I could have done to improve this photo.   if you are open to helpful criticism then dont just check the compliments as "helpful" you''ll learn alot more from the critical ones, i know from experience', '2010-02-17 00:29:16.000000', NULL, 0),
