(5870406, 852224, 31456, '<td valign="top">I do agree on the motion blur thing, this shot is just begging for some. Maybe if you''d kept the slower shutter and kept clicking you would''ve gotten at least one no-shake-but-plenty-of-motion shot. Anyway, good DOF and color... though a bit overexposed in some areas.</td>', 'I do agree on the motion blur thing, this shot is just begging for some. Maybe if you''d kept the slower shutter and kept clicking you would''ve gotten at least one no-shake-but-plenty-of-motion shot. Anyway, good DOF and color... though a bit overexposed in some areas.', '2010-02-17 01:00:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870410, 853270, 31456, '<td valign="top">Really cool concept, though I would''ve liked to see a bit more of the trees in focus. Either the camera pointed down a bit, or an f/11-16 aperture, or both... anyway, good colors and like I said... cool concept :)</td>', 'Really cool concept, though I would''ve liked to see a bit more of the trees in focus. Either the camera pointed down a bit, or an f/11-16 aperture, or both... anyway, good colors and like I said... cool concept :)', '2010-02-17 01:01:26.000000', NULL, 0),
