(5870415, 853180, 31456, '<td valign="top">This feels tilted, I don''t know why. Nice colors and sharpness, though a bit uninteresting to me (especially the centered composition).</td>', 'This feels tilted, I don''t know why. Nice colors and sharpness, though a bit uninteresting to me (especially the centered composition).', '2010-02-17 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870416, 852900, 31456, '<td valign="top">I like the title. Oh, and the colors/sharpness/depth of field/colors/composition are awesome! I don''t know why this didn''t place higher, it''s really really good.</td>', 'I like the title. Oh, and the colors/sharpness/depth of field/colors/composition are awesome! I don''t know why this didn''t place higher, it''s really really good.', '2010-02-17 01:08:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870418, 852584, 108580, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe this got 26th. You were robbed. Most magnificent image.</td>', 'I cannot believe this got 26th. You were robbed. Most magnificent image.', '2010-02-17 01:09:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870419, 852858, 31456, '<td valign="top">It''s cool, but it''s like a lot of other dark-road-at-night shots. Maybe an area with brighter lighting would''ve worked better, it''s a bit too simple right now.</td>', 'It''s cool, but it''s like a lot of other dark-road-at-night shots. Maybe an area with brighter lighting would''ve worked better, it''s a bit too simple right now.', '2010-02-17 01:09:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870420, 853204, 31456, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and composition. The colors in the sky are really nice (circular polarizer?). Great sense of motion and excitement. There''s really nothing I''d change about this.</td>', 'Nice angle and composition. The colors in the sky are really nice (circular polarizer?). Great sense of motion and excitement. There''s really nothing I''d change about this.', '2010-02-17 01:12:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870422, 852904, 31456, '<td valign="top">I like that the lights still look like they''re shining on the beams, although it''s inverted. Really really well done, with good tones. The deep blacks work really well, especially with the very high-key tower.</td>', 'I like that the lights still look like they''re shining on the beams, although it''s inverted. Really really well done, with good tones. The deep blacks work really well, especially with the very high-key tower.', '2010-02-17 01:14:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870423, 853069, 54799, '<td valign="top">this is a beauty of an image :)</td>', 'this is a beauty of an image :)', '2010-02-17 01:14:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870425, 853244, 31456, '<td valign="top">Love the softness and the overexposed top. Good "story" feeling, especially with those two walking through. Would''ve liked the browns to be as strong (saturated) as the greens, but I''m just nitpicking now.</td>', 'Love the softness and the overexposed top. Good "story" feeling, especially with those two walking through. Would''ve liked the browns to be as strong (saturated) as the greens, but I''m just nitpicking now.', '2010-02-17 01:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870426, 852885, 31456, '<td valign="top">Different take - not just a shot from an interesting perspective, but a shot in which you see all different perspectives. A bit soft in the headlight, though, and the greens could use a bit more saturation.</td>', 'Different take - not just a shot from an interesting perspective, but a shot in which you see all different perspectives. A bit soft in the headlight, though, and the greens could use a bit more saturation.', '2010-02-17 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870427, 852915, 64844, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue ribbon!!! This is such a cool shot! I like the shiny belly of the plane!<br/> <br/>I took a shot like this last year at Frankfurt airport - but with a fisheye which made the plane look so far away that all that roar that you should feel, looking at it, disappeared.<br/> <br/>Your photo still has this feel of airplane sound, and the interesting tilt really makes this look like an acrobatic maneuver :)</td>', 'Congratulations on the blue ribbon!!! This is such a cool shot! I like the shiny belly of the plane! I took a shot like this last year at Frankfurt airport - but with a fisheye which made the plane look so far away that all that roar that you should feel, looking at it, disappeared. Your photo still has this feel of airplane sound, and the interesting tilt really makes this look like an acrobatic maneuver :)', '2010-02-17 01:20:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870428, 852941, 31456, '<td valign="top">Topaz looks great in 95% of the image. A bit overdone on the walls, though... was the texture really that contrast-y there? Other than that, it''s really really well done, with really nice, strong colors and sharpness.</td>', 'Topaz looks great in 95% of the image. A bit overdone on the walls, though... was the texture really that contrast-y there? Other than that, it''s really really well done, with really nice, strong colors and sharpness.', '2010-02-17 01:21:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870429, 853263, 108580, '<td valign="top">50th place? That makes no sense. This is a wonderful image, perhaps not pin sharp on the stars (I''m not talking about the motion blur) but still...</td>', '50th place? That makes no sense. This is a wonderful image, perhaps not pin sharp on the stars (I''m not talking about the motion blur) but still...', '2010-02-17 01:22:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870430, 853113, 64844, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the Red! Well deserved!</td>', 'Congratulations on the Red! Well deserved!', '2010-02-17 01:22:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870431, 852915, 68504, '<td valign="top">Very congrats, horse person.  It is ALL about perspective.  The word "humdinger" comes to mind. Love the clouds.</td>', 'Very congrats, horse person.  It is ALL about perspective.  The word "humdinger" comes to mind. Love the clouds.', '2010-02-17 01:25:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870434, 852962, 31456, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot that''s processed really well... except for the sky. There''s a strong halo right around the edge of the church. Other than that, with these colors and sharpness, it''s a great shot.</td>', 'This is a good shot that''s processed really well... except for the sky. There''s a strong halo right around the edge of the church. Other than that, with these colors and sharpness, it''s a great shot.', '2010-02-17 01:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870435, 852593, 68504, '<td valign="top">Quite wonderful.</td>', 'Quite wonderful.', '2010-02-17 01:27:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870436, 852364, 31456, '<td valign="top">It DID make it to the top! Congrats! I''m a sucker for violins (been playing for ...14 years?), so that makes it even better for me. I don''t have anything to say about the shot, it''s just the perfect violin shot to me.</td>', 'It DID make it to the top! Congrats! I''m a sucker for violins (been playing for ...14 years?), so that makes it even better for me. I don''t have anything to say about the shot, it''s just the perfect violin shot to me.', '2010-02-17 01:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870437, 853069, 103004, '<td valign="top">what a great image...Congratulations!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-17 06:47:43.</i></td>', 'what a great image...Congratulations!', '2010-02-17 01:30:46.000000', '2010-02-17 06:47:43.000000', 0),
(5870438, 853232, 68504, '<td valign="top">I am so relieved to have this explained.  I found it quite chilling - I was thinking locker room for the armygeddon/geddonarmy, detention cubicles; and all the time it was just the heavy carapactory of recorded utterance.</td>', 'I am so relieved to have this explained.  I found it quite chilling - I was thinking locker room for the armygeddon/geddonarmy, detention cubicles; and all the time it was just the heavy carapactory of recorded utterance.', '2010-02-17 01:31:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870440, 852584, 68504, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of Vivaldi - the not quite meeting sweeps of lines.</td>', 'Makes me think of Vivaldi - the not quite meeting sweeps of lines.', '2010-02-17 01:33:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870441, 853086, 68504, '<td valign="top">I thought so.  Definitely one of my favourites in the challenge.  Very powerful.</td>', 'I thought so.  Definitely one of my favourites in the challenge.  Very powerful.', '2010-02-17 01:34:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870442, 852915, 103004, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Congratulations!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-17 15:55:46.</i></td>', 'Great shot, Congratulations!', '2010-02-17 01:38:44.000000', '2010-02-17 15:55:46.000000', 0),
(5870450, 852885, 68504, '<td valign="top">Cool how the reflecting hub distorts the other car''s similar tire.</td>', 'Cool how the reflecting hub distorts the other car''s similar tire.', '2010-02-17 01:46:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870453, 852971, 68504, '<td valign="top">Very strong photo.</td>', 'Very strong photo.', '2010-02-17 01:48:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5870459, 852066, 68504, '<td valign="top">The person in the middle makes this photo!  Everything about him segues right into linear but vertiginous structure.  OK, I really love the hair.</td>', 'The person in the middle makes this photo!  Everything about him segues right into linear but vertiginous structure.  OK, I really love the hair.', '2010-02-17 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
