(5870559, 853228, 28742, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I just mentioned this on another entry, but it applies here too: If I had my own ROFLMAO awards, this would get one. :-)<br/> <br/>ps: I''ve used the Grunting Remote on occasion and was fairly pleased with it''s ease of use.<br/> <br/>pps: If I was in charge of creating reality TV shows, "Lydia''s House" would be on the top of my list.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-17 02:57:07.</i></td>', 'Yeah, I just mentioned this on another entry, but it applies here too: If I had my own ROFLMAO awards, this would get one. :-) ps: I''ve used the Grunting Remote on occasion and was fairly pleased with it''s ease of use. pps: If I was in charge of creating reality TV shows, "Lydia''s House" would be on the top of my list.', '2010-02-17 02:54:47.000000', '2010-02-17 02:57:07.000000', 0),
(5870565, 852046, 28742, '<td valign="top">You should have <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=59029" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Miss Susan</a> give you some pointers on this type of shot. :P<br/> <br/>ps: I gave this an 8. Would have been a 10 with <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=854819" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">a slightly different edit</a>. :P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-17 03:09:21.</i></td>', 'You should have Miss Susan give you some pointers on this type of shot. :P ps: I gave this an 8. Would have been a 10 with a slightly different edit. :P', '2010-02-17 02:59:20.000000', '2010-02-17 03:09:21.000000', 0),
