(5870841, 852551, 110046, '<td valign="top">thanks all for comments lol . I did have some issues with uploading the file, although i used the Max size it still wasnt allowing me to upload so i kept making it smaller! I will admit i reached for the perspective category @_@ . I do agree now that i look at it i may have made the saturation a bit much, but i do liek extremely bight colors especially on all white back ground but i do see how i lost the detail in the photo, thanks for that critique i will be more careful with my editing! I defintely did not copy paste onto a white background lol i did use a white light box that allowed me to get a smooth white background. Thanks all for taking the time to look and critque, I am a newbie so i appreciate it, good or bad! :)</td>', 'thanks all for comments lol . I did have some issues with uploading the file, although i used the Max size it still wasnt allowing me to upload so i kept making it smaller! I will admit i reached for the perspective category @_@ . I do agree now that i look at it i may have made the saturation a bit much, but i do liek extremely bight colors especially on all white back ground but i do see how i lost the detail in the photo, thanks for that critique i will be more careful with my editing! I defintely did not copy paste onto a white background lol i did use a white light box that allowed me to get a smooth white background. Thanks all for taking the time to look and critque, I am a newbie so i appreciate it, good or bad! :)', '2010-02-17 09:25:05.000000', NULL, 0),
