(5870933, 852963, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by george917:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice location, but a bit busy in some places and very empty in others. Very nice color, and you placed the main elements well. Sweet stars on the lights.<br/> <br/>ETA: Why is there a black band on the right? I don''t remember that being there before... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>yeah i saw that half way thru voting, dont know how i did that, something screwy when i was editing it</td>', 'Originally posted by george917: Nice location, but a bit busy in some places and very empty in others. Very nice color, and you placed the main elements well. Sweet stars on the lights. ETA: Why is there a black band on the right? I don''t remember that being there before...   yeah i saw that half way thru voting, dont know how i did that, something screwy when i was editing it', '2010-02-17 11:14:34.000000', NULL, 0),
