(5877246, 852915, 18367, '<td valign="top">A truly wonderful image. well worthy of its'' placement at the top of the heap.<br/> <br/>Your photography has improved by leaps and bounds from the days when I first met you at the library and am proud to say that I knew you when you first started out.  Very nicely done, and I have no doubts that, given your drive and devotion, that you will astound us with your creativity and talent.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'A truly wonderful image. well worthy of its'' placement at the top of the heap. Your photography has improved by leaps and bounds from the days when I first met you at the library and am proud to say that I knew you when you first started out.  Very nicely done, and I have no doubts that, given your drive and devotion, that you will astound us with your creativity and talent. Keep up the good work. Ray', '2010-02-22 21:32:16.000000', NULL, 0),
