(5881019, 852915, 108544, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the fantastic finish! It was so nice to see your face on roll over. Even better, you did not notice your image, till I pointed it out. Oh my God, I got the blue ribbon! lol Priceless....<br/>So here''s to many more fantastic shoots with you Snaffles. You are truly, one special women.</td>', 'Congratulations on the fantastic finish! It was so nice to see your face on roll over. Even better, you did not notice your image, till I pointed it out. Oh my God, I got the blue ribbon! lol Priceless....So here''s to many more fantastic shoots with you Snaffles. You are truly, one special women.', '2010-02-25 18:07:05.000000', NULL, 0),
