(6781639, 852915, 129222, '<td valign="top">Holy Cow!!! Snaffles what an amazing shot. I''ve never seen a jet from this perspective before. Congrats on your Blue. ----I''ve decided to go through all my comments and look at their profiles. This might take a few weeks as I''m writing Exams and report cards  right now. I want to get to know this community better, and thank everyone personally. You''re at the top of my comments, so I''ll start with you. I have been living in Taiwan since 1996 and have only returned home once in all that time. Out of touch with planet Earth. Take Care, bye for now.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Holy Cow!!! Snaffles what an amazing shot. I''ve never seen a jet from this perspective before. Congrats on your Blue. ----I''ve decided to go through all my comments and look at their profiles. This might take a few weeks as I''m writing Exams and report cards  right now. I want to get to know this community better, and thank everyone personally. You''re at the top of my comments, so I''ll start with you. I have been living in Taiwan since 1996 and have only returned home once in all that time. Out of touch with planet Earth. Take Care, bye for now. ', '2012-05-30 13:02:49.000000', NULL, 0),
